-   - an active source/context file such as `sireum_verification_plan.txt` or `syml-spec-meta-rules-explainations.txt`.
-3. If the manifest is missing, continue only with the listed final rule books and active project files; do not substitute `eva-results` or any snapshot path.
-4. If a path contains `eva-results`, `eval_results`, `verification-profiles`, `snapshot`, `clean-profile`, `hamr-clean`, or `golden-clean`, reject it as user-mode input.
